  "contentHtml": "<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><STRONG><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. 교과 내용에 대한 고민</SPAN></STRONG></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;판구조론은 이론적인 내용이 참 많습니다</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;마치 고등학교 지학 내용이 중학교로 내려온 느낌입니다</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;중</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학생들의 수준에 맞는 것인지</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">너무 지식 내용이 많은 것은 아닌지 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;국가수준 교육과정을 만드시는 분들은 고민해주시길 바랍니다</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">!</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;(</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">국가 수준의 성취기준에 있다고 해서 꼭 가르쳐야 할까요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">? </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; 교사들의 교육과정 재구성의 권한은 어디까지 인지요</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?)</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><STRONG>2. 우리는 지식 전달자?</STRONG></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;<SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 우리는 학생들 앞에서 강의를 해야할까요</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">? </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp; 우리는 동영상으로 '강의'를 해야 할까요?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\">&nbsp; 학생들에게 여전히 지식을 가르쳐야 할까요</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P></SPAN>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><STRONG><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3. 예습의 부담감</SPAN></STRONG></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; 집에서 동영상 예습을 하는 것이 부담스러운 많은 아이들은 어떻게?</SPAN></SPAN></P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P></SPAN>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><STRONG><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. 실제 수업 시간에는 뭘해야 할까?</SPAN></STRONG></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; 1) 예습한 내용을 바탕으로 문제 풀기</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 개념을 적용 응용하는 활동하기</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; 3) 개념을 바탕으로 토의하기</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;4)...</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">그리고 </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">이번 18</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일 부산 연수 때</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">탐구문제 1~4 에 대한 논의가 이뤄지길 기대해봅니다.</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>(제가 커피값이라도 은행이체 해드릴까요? ^^)</P></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P></SPAN>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">고맙습니다.</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P></SPAN>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
